  Slug: former-aspis-agent
  DisplayName: Former Aspis Agent
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: For more than a century, the Pathfinder Society has clashed with the
    avaricious and underhanded Aspis Consortium, and several years ago the Society
    dealt its rival a decisive blow. You may be one of the few survivors of a doomed
    Aspis expedition, or perhaps you chafed at the Consortium's villainous practices
    and defected to the Pathfinders. No matter your reasons, you know how to be efficient
    and ruthless when the circumstances demand. Choose two attribute boosts. One
    must be to Intelligence or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Intimidation skill and the Aspis Consortium Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Group Coercion] skill feat. You gain
    access to any uncommon options as though you were a member of the Aspis Consortium.
    Special You can select this background only if you have earned credit for at
    least 5 First Edition scenarios from Season 7 of the Pathfinder Society organized
    play campaign.
